                <p>See footnote 4, <ref target="#pg1573">p. 1573</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d58-f3" n="3" xml:id="d58-f3-content">
                <p>See footnote 1, <ref target="#pg1577">p. 1577</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d58-f4" n="4" xml:id="d58-f4-content">
                <p>In telegram 6613, to G–3, Department of the Army, November 17, General Pierson
                    stated: “I have again consulted with Embassy on control of napalm and both
                    Embassy and JUSMAG agree that the controls
                    enumerated in JUSMAG 6571 fully serve the
                    purpose recm by State and that further consultation and agreement between
                    Embassy and me prior to use of napalm not nec.” (Manila Post Files: 430.1 Napalm
                    Bomb)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
